<title>POLAND: PLI to issue up to 3.5 million new shares.</title>
<headline>PLI to issue up to 3.5 million new shares.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish wholesale and retail trader Polish Life Improvement SA (PLI) plans a capital increase of one million to 3.5 million common shares worth two million to seven million zlotys, the firm said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>The ex-rights issue must be approved at a shareholders meeting set for December 6, the statement said.</p>
<p>PLI currently has 7,051,213 shares outstanding.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
